OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening, with
OL,7,Fremaining cloud over central and
OL,8,Fsouthern areas clearing to leave
OL,9,Flargely clear skies.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start,
OL,12,Fit will be a dry day with largely
OL,13,Fclear skies and plenty of sunshine.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells on Saturday. Mostly
OL,17,Fdry on Sunday but turning cloudier,
OL,18,Fperhaps some patchy rain in west.
OL,19,FMonday will be cloudy with outbreaks
OL,20,Fof rain and strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
